# <wtl> project: c4 | file: .scanignore | author: watchthelight </wtl>
# Globs (fnmatch, relative to the repo root) that scripts/scan.py skips. Only fixture directories whose
# files must contain fake secrets, socket names or process start times belong here, plus the generated
# notices file, whose third-party license texts carry their authors' addresses; everything else in
# fixtures/ is still scanned.
fixtures/home/sessions/*
fixtures/home/daemon/*
fixtures/home/jobs/*
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
